Package: adaptivejump
Type: Package
Title: Adaptive Jump Tests for High-Frequency Financial Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Huifang", family = "Ma", role = "aut"),
    person(given = "Long", family = "Feng", email = "flnankai@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Implements the adaptive jump-testing procedures in Ma and Feng,
    \"Adaptive Test for Jump\".  The package provides the frictionless
    Ait-Sahalia--Jacod power-variation test, the Lee--Mykland max test, their
    Cauchy combination, and noise-robust pre-averaged and local-average
    extensions.  It also supplies simulation data-generating processes and
    utilities for regular-session intraday data.
